<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A somewhat tormented man unable to make any meaningful communication with the foundation. Nearly everything he says or writes comes out as meaningless nonsense or irrelevant information. He was discovered and captured shortly after dialling the number of 05-█ and waiting to be tracked down. How he knew the number, where he came from, and what his motives are are all things that the foundation has been unable to work out (not for lack of trying).</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> None</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> I believe that the challenge presented to the foundation by this SCP makes for a fairly unique concept. Additionally, the mystery of his background and general nature leaves room for speculation and imagination on behalf of the reader.</p>

